# API Contracts

## Patterns
- Controllers expose DTOs with class-validator; gateway merges OpenAPI
- Committed spec: `docs/api/openapi-merged.json`
- Envelope responses and `AllExceptionsFilter` standardize errors

## Rules
- Every new/changed endpoint updates Swagger decorators and DTOs
- After API shape changes: `pnpm openapi:export` then `pnpm contract:check` / `pnpm openapi:lint`
- Do not hand-edit `docs/api/openapi-merged.json` — regenerate
- Breaking changes need `pnpm openapi:diff` awareness and frontend codegen coordination
- Public vs authenticated routes must be explicit; never accidentally drop guards
- Validate pagination/filter bounds; reject unknown properties (whitelist pipe)
